      "writtenOn": "2024-12-30T17:57:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The return value here is `bool`, not an EC error code. You shouldn\u0027t be returning it from `get_message_raw`. That should always be the return value of `tcpci_tcpm_get_message_raw` the last TCPC operation.\n\nAs written, there\u0027s nothing to do with the return value of `should_enter_bist_mode` here. I\u0027d suggest changing the code like this:\n```suggestion\n\tif (raa489000_tcpm_should_enter_bist_mode(port, payload, head)) {\n\t        raa489000_bist_mode[port] \u003d true;\n\t        return tcpci_set_bist_test_mode(port, true);\n\t}\n```",
